Mineralogy and petrology sources — books, laboratories, analytical methods, and research (@mp-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mineralogy-and-petrology) { r_38Q6Z3J7ER2G1B441JXJ14NV5A
Complete books, full methods, named course/laboratory studies, and primary research provide the substantial reading. The Records connect them with original explanations, calculations, and progressively deeper work. Edition, attribution, licence, free consultation, and automated-access limits are distinguished in each entry.

